  triage:title "help.rs test assertions use contains() instead of starts_with() where applicable" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm/src/commands/help.rs — test assertions use .contains() where .starts_with() or assert_eq! would be more precise. Fix: replace contains() with starts_with() or assert_eq! where the assertion is testing a prefix or exact match." ;
