  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pY-s2-pre-smoke-easy-fixes/63f9c1a8> ;
  triage:sweepNotes "Reviewed crates/atm/src/commands/help.rs test block tier_two_topics_include_concrete_examples_after_y2(). All .contains() calls are appropriate for testing substring presence within help text body. No instances found where .starts_with() or assert_eq! would be more precise. Existing .starts_with() at line 468 is already correct. Finding is absent on pY-s2." .

